# Aegis backend

## Layout
- Entry: `backend/app/main.py`
- Config: `backend/app/config.py`
- API: `backend/app/api/` (auth, repos, scans, stats, webhooks)
- Agents: `backend/app/agents/` (finder, engineer, reviewer, pr_creator)
- Orchestrator: `backend/app/pipeline/orchestrator.py`
- RAG: `backend/app/rag/` · Scanner: `backend/app/scanner/semgrep.py`
- GitHub App: `backend/app/github/` · Models: `backend/app/models/entities.py`
- Sandbox CLI: `backend/runner/aegis_cli.py`

## Conventions
- Imports use `backend.app.*` (PYTHONPATH=/app in Docker).
- Prefer structured logging with scan context.
- Agent contract changes must stay aligned with frontend TypeScript types in the same change.
- Engineer patches should include regression-test output per project conventions.
- Reviewer should validate AST/safety before PR creation.
- Webhook + auth paths: fail closed; use fixtures for tests instead of disabling verification.

## Tests
- E2E: `backend/tests/test_e2e_pipeline.py` / `./test-pipeline.sh`
- Blackbox: `backend/tests/blackbox/` + `pipeline-test-*.sh` at repo root
